{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101653","id":2793880847,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6mhz0P","number":101653,"title":"AudioStreamPlayer plays audio across scenes when triggered through AnimationPlayer in web export","user":{"login":"elpozewaunig","id":64259275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU5Mjc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64259275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig","html_url":"https://github.com/elpozewaunig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-01-16T22:05:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T11:32:59Z","closed_at":"2025-01-20T20:04:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.3.stable, 4.4.dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7 - macOS Sequoia (15.1.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using sample-based playback (in web exports) and playing a clip in an AudioStreamPlayer through an AnimationPlayer and switching scenes, audio playback persists across scene changes, with the developer unable to ever stop the audio until it either ends (which will not ever be the case for audio imported with the `loop` property set to true) or the game is restarted.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create new scene, add AudioStreamPlayer\n2. Import (ideally long or looping) audio file\n3. Create AnimationPlayer, add an Audio Playback Track to the AudioStreamPlayer in the AnimationPlayer playing the previously imported audio\n4. Add a way to change to another scene\n5. In a web export, switch scenes before the audio has finished playing\n6. Observe that the audio continues playing with no way to stop it\n\nAlternatively (with MRP):\n1. Open minimal reproduction project\n2. Run web export\n3. Click \"change scene\" button to switch to scene with audio\n4. Click \"change scene\" button to switch back to a \"silent\" scene\n5. The scene will still be playing audio. Repeating the process stacks the audio on top of each other\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[web-cross-scene-audio-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18445820/web-cross-scene-audio-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"elpozewaunig","id":64259275,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU5Mjc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64259275?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig","html_url":"https://github.com/elpozewaunig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elpozewaunig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101653/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}